# .gitignore
#
# A list of things git should pretend don't exist.
# Anything matching a line here is never tracked, never committed,
# and never uploaded to GitHub.

# macOS drops one of these invisible files into every folder you
# open in Finder. It stores icon positions. It is not part of your
# project and it causes pointless changes in every commit.
.DS_Store

# Windows does the same thing with this one.
Thumbs.db

# Temporary files left behind by text editors.
*.swp
*~
